    "isUpgradable": false,
    "mainInfo": "<p style=\"font-size:16px; \">\n  The main goal of ADP bundle is an easy and fast installation\n  and managing of Arenadata Prosperity with Arenadata Cluster Manager.\n  ADP bundle consists of ADPG, time synchronization and\n  the monitoring client services. These services can be installed\n  either on cloud or bare metal hosts (depending on host bundles\n  you choose). After installation ADP cluster\n  will be available for psql connect on the master\n  host address.\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  Documentation: <a href=\"https://docs.arenadata.io/en/landing-adpg/index.html\">https://docs.arenadata.io/en/landing-adpg/index.html</a>\n</p>\n"
  },
