      "mainInfo": "<div>\n    <p>Service necessary for obtaining, saving and interactive display of information on the state of controlled elements of the cluster.</p>\n</div><div>\n<p>Accessing the metrics being collected is possible using:</p>\n<p><h3>Prometheus</h3></p>\n<p>Prometheus is an open-source systems monitoring and alerting toolkit.</p>\n<table>\n   <tr>\n      <th>Hostname</th>\n      <th>IP</th>\n      <th>Login Page</th>\n   </tr><tr>\n      <td>tiabd-albakhtin-iv</td>\n      <td>10.0.2.15</td>\n      <td><a href=\"http://tiabd-albakhtin-iv:11200\">tiabd-albakhtin-iv:11200</a></td>\n   </tr></table>\n\n<p><h3>Grafana</h3></p>\n<p>Grafana is an open source analytics and interactive visualization web application.</p>\n<table>\n   <tr>\n      <th>Hostname</th>\n      <th>IP</th>\n      <th>Login Page</th>\n   </tr><tr>\n      <td>tiabd-albakhtin-iv</td>\n      <td>10.0.2.15</td>\n      <td><a href=\"http://tiabd-albakhtin-iv:11210\">tiabd-albakhtin-iv:11210</a></td>\n   </tr></table>\n\n</div>\n"
