      "isMaintenanceModeAvailable": false,
      "maintenanceMode": "off",
      "mainInfo": "<p>Arenadata Postgres (ADPG) is a DBMS for efficient work with loads of different profiles (primarily OLTP - Online Transaction Processing).</p>\n<p>ADPG allows you to work with various amounts of data and supports a wide range of data types (including JSON and custom types) with the ability to create data processing mechanisms.</p>\n<p>ADPG is based on the object-relational Open Source DBMS PostgreSQL.</p>\n\n<p>Key features of PostgreSQL:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Complex queries that process large amounts of data, including complex analytical functions (including user behavior analytics).</li>\n  <li>Any types of reporting (operational, managerial, mandatory regulatory).</li>\n  <li>Deep AD-HOC analysis.</li>\n  <li>Efficient connection of large tables.</li>\n  <li>Operation of marketing campaign systems and loyalty systems.</li>\n  <li>Different scoring.</li>\n  <li>Predictive analytics (demand, balances).</li>\n</ul>\n<br/>\n<table style=\"text-align: left;\">\n    <tr>\n        <th>Host: 192.168.56.103</th>\n        <th>&nbsp;&nbsp;</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>Postgres JDBC URL:</td>\n        <td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"jdbc:postgresql://10.0.2.15:5432\">jdbc:postgresql://10.0.2.15:5432</a></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td colspan=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n"
    }
